Adventurer,

*Albion East* is up and running, and the world is growing as players rush i=
n to the server and more Outlands regions are opened up. As this brand-new =
world develops, now is your last chance to grab an *Albion East Founder Pac=
k* ( https://albiononline.com/asia#founderpacks ).

These Founder Packs come in four different tiers, offering combinations of =
*Gold* , *Premium* , *Vanity* , and more. So along with getting you off to =
the right start as you develop your characters, you can get lasting memento=
s of this unique moment in Albion=E2=80=99s history that will never be sold=
 again, for example:

* Exclusive sailor-themed *Wardrobe Skins*
* Exclusive matching *Mount Skins*
* Exclusive *Statue* and *Furniture items*

( https://albiononline.com/asia#founderpacks )

Albion East Founder Packs are available until *April 30* , so *pick one up =
now* ( https://albiononline.com/asia#founderpacks ) !

Dev Talk: 2023 Development Update
---------------------------------

A new *Dev Talk* is here, in which Game Director Robin Henkys discusses wha=
t's next for the world of Albion, including some insights into upcoming fea=
tures that are in development.

Watch the Dev Talk here (includes subtitles for all supported languages):

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DQIOAQ5EVch8 )

Short on time? Read a written summary *here* ( https://albiononline.com/new=
s/devtalk-2023-development ).

Claim Founder Pack Rewards on Albion West
-----------------------------------------

Remember that *Albion East Founder Pack* ( https://albiononline.com/asia#fo=
underpacks ) rewards can also be claimed on *Albion West* , so you can bene=
fit from them no matter which server you prefer. Pick one up today:

